"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nA coffee shop inside the Queen Victoria Building (QVB).\n\nOrdered the signature White Rabbit latte and a Long Black.  \nThe latte was topped with orange zest and had a clean, smooth finish overall.  \nHonestly, I'm not sure whether it was exceptionally good.\n\nThat said, QVB is somewhere you'll likely end up visiting in Sydney,  \nand grabbing a coffee there for a break isn't a bad choice at all.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n"